    {
      "body": "The branch has been refreshed against current `main` (`f2b73d4f9b`) and the focused regression coverage has been updated. GitHub currently rejects reopening this PR through both the REST API (HTTP 422) and the official CLI, so the same work now continues in #44424. The updated implementation, local validation details, and reviewer follow-up are recorded there. Thank you for the discussion and guidance here.",
